# 排除 host 的 node_modules（macOS 的 native binaries 在 Linux 不兼容）
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.cache

# Git
.git
.github

# Editor
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Env（容器内使用独立 env）
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.prod

# Logs
*.log
logs

# Docs / plans
docs
.plans
.agents
.claude
chat-history

# Electron（源码保留以满足 workspace 解析，但不会启动 GUI）
# For web-mode: exclude Electron changelogs, native macOS helpers and Electron-only build artifacts.
# The apps/desktop TypeScript still gets included so workspace resolution works.
apps/desktop/changelogs
apps/desktop/native
apps/desktop/.webpack

# Tests cache
**/coverage

# Local scratch (from author's laptop) — don't ship into the image
**/*.pplx.md
test-results
playwright-report
